- **router1** (AS 1): `neighbor 193.10.11.2 remote-as 2` ✓ — correctly expects router2 to be AS 2.
- **router2** (AS 2): `neighbor 193.10.11.1 remote-as 65001` ✗ — incorrectly expects router1 to be AS **65001**, but router1 is actually AS **1**.

